{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/1f7715ae911c964b71ba5fd26fd788f9.avif?t=1760014579\" alt=\"Logo\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological survival horror where you play as disgraced journalist <i>Oswald Weeby</i>, who has lost his job and his wife after a lifetime of chasing fame and people\u2019s approval. As a result, he believes he can fix his life by uncovering the mystery behind the disappearances at the Royal Veil Hotel \u2014 a famous ongoing conspiracy case with no answers. Even the police have failed to solve it, with many officers disappearing during their investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange creatures and carefully navigate the hotel, as these creatures will chase you down and devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/67b482ed04a1f3375863bd5025ed4db3.poster.avif?t=1760014579\" aria-label=\"Experience the horror\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/67b482ed04a1f3375863bd5025ed4db3.webm?t=1760014579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Ammunition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep count of your bullets and fire only when necessary, as you will have to manually insert each bullet yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/fdcd3623014518e0b05ab91c7aa8c0d0.poster.avif?t=1760014579\" aria-label=\"Combat &amp;amp; Ammunition\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/fdcd3623014518e0b05ab91c7aa8c0d0.webm?t=1760014579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings and search for loot across the map. You will need every resource you can find to fight off the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/65e62ff06156d38e04f3aa85edf82bf2.poster.avif?t=1760014579\" aria-label=\"Exploration\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/65e62ff06156d38e04f3aa85edf82bf2.webm?t=1760014579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and resources carefully, as there are only limited supplies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/extras/466022eab0ab5e5216f07941bf515408.avif?t=1760014579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944010?t=1760014579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/ad5e7b6bd2eb6410975dda31c785d6f39f00e1d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760014579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944010/d7118e8c45825b55052e91c5bb00f98f4d4a